WEBVTT

00:00:00.458 --> 00:00:01.960
Previously on Love Live!

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:06.089
The three of us jumped a new hurdle—
our first concert as school idols.

00:00:06.089 --> 00:00:07.674
Attend our concert!

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:09.551
The very first concert for p's!

00:00:09.551 --> 00:00:12.345
May our concert be a success.

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:14.973
No, may our concert
be a mega success!

00:00:14.973 --> 00:00:17.642
Please grant our wishes!

00:00:18.226 --> 00:00:19.436
However...

00:00:22.314 --> 00:00:23.773
And what will you do now?

00:00:24.316 --> 00:00:30.071
We said that we will keep singing, with the
dream of performing before a full house.

00:00:36.077 --> 00:00:38.079
Recruiting members!! Let's sweat
the sweat of youth!! What should I do?

00:00:38.788 --> 00:00:41.207
Hanayo-chan, what do you want to be?

00:00:41.666 --> 00:00:44.044
Me? U-Um...

00:00:44.336 --> 00:00:48.381
I know. Kayo-chin wants to be an idol, right?

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:50.342
An idol? That sounds cool.

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:52.302
W-Well...

00:00:52.302 --> 00:00:55.180
She has all the dances perfectly memorized.

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:57.057
Really? You can do it, then!

00:00:57.265 --> 00:00:58.642
S-Sure...

00:00:59.768 --> 00:01:01.728
Koizumi, read the next section.

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:02.937
Y-Yes.

00:01:03.438 --> 00:01:06.232
"He gave me some advice."

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:07.776
Project a little more.

00:01:08.151 --> 00:01:09.653
Sure.

00:01:09.653 --> 00:01:12.864
"I was deeply moved by the..."

00:01:12.864 --> 00:01:14.407
Okay, enough.

00:01:14.699 --> 00:01:17.535
Could you read the same line, Imai?

00:01:17.535 --> 00:01:18.536
Sure.

00:01:19.245 --> 00:01:21.456
If I'm like this, there's no way...

00:01:33.677 --> 00:01:38.807
<i>massugu ha omoi ga minna wo musubu Our honest
feelings are what will fie us all together.</i>

00:01:38.807 --> 00:01:43.561
Honki demo bukiyou butsukari au kokoro Even with
our clumsy sincerity, our hearts will still collide.

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:48.566
Sore demo mitaiyo ohkina yume wa And despite
it all, we want to dream a really grand dream.

00:01:48.566 --> 00:01:53.154
Koko ni aruyo hajimatta bakari That dream
is here, and it has only now just begun!

00:01:53.154 --> 00:01:54.239
(wakatteru)
(We understand)

00:01:54.239 --> 00:01:58.118
Tanoshii dakejanai tamesarerudarou That it's not
all fun and games— we'll face a lot of obstacles.

00:01:58.118 --> 00:01:59.119
(wakatteru)
(We understand)

00:01:59.119 --> 00:02:02.914
Datte sono kurushisa mo mirai That those
hardships will be paving our futures...

00:02:02.914 --> 00:02:03.957
ikundayo
So here we go!

00:02:03.957 --> 00:02:08.086
Atsumattara tsuyoi jibun ni nattekuyo If we all
join together, we'll be able to become stronger.

00:02:08.086 --> 00:02:12.716
(Kittone) kawari tsuzukete (WE'LL BE A STARY/) (We're sure
that) we will all grow and mature. (We'll become stars!)

00:02:12.716 --> 00:02:17.721
Sorezore ga sukina koto de ganbarerunara That's why we feel
that if we give the things that we love the most our all,

00:02:17.721 --> 00:02:22.392
atarashii (basho ga) gohru dane what awaits
then (our new place) will be our goal.

00:02:22.392 --> 00:02:27.564
Sorezore no sukina koto wo shinjiteireba That's why we
feel that if we believe in the things we love in our lives,

00:02:27.564 --> 00:02:32.527
tokimeki wo (daite) susumerudarou we can learn to
love (then embrace) our butterflies and advance!

00:02:32.527 --> 00:02:38.032
(kowagaru kuse wa sutechae) tobikiri no egao de So crumple up your
fears, throw them away, and then just put on your brightest smiles!

00:02:38.032 --> 00:02:45.582
(tonde tonde takaku) bokura wa ima no naka de (Higher and higher
we"ll fly) The lights that are shining within our hearts...

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:50.336
kagayaki wo matteta
They're waiting to brighten the world.

00:02:58.136 --> 00:03:00.722
Lately, Kotori-chan's been
coming here every day.

00:03:00.722 --> 00:03:04.684
#4 - Maki Rin Pana - It's a sudden obsession of hers.
- C'mon, we gotta go hand out fliers.

00:03:04.684 --> 00:03:06.311
Gimme a few more seconds.

00:03:06.311 --> 00:03:07.479
Jeez...

00:03:07.479 --> 00:03:10.190
If we can't gather five members and
be accepted as a legitimate club,

00:03:10.190 --> 00:03:12.484
we'll be unable to conduct club activities.

00:03:12.484 --> 00:03:15.695
Yeah, I know that...

00:03:15.695 --> 00:03:19.073
<i>Do you.. think these are cute?</i>

00:03:19.073 --> 00:03:21.951
What? Yeah, they're so adorable.

00:03:21.951 --> 00:03:24.496
Feel how fluffy their necks are!

00:03:26.372 --> 00:03:27.665
I'm in heaven...!

00:03:27.665 --> 00:03:29.209
Kotori-chan, don't.

00:03:29.209 --> 00:03:30.502
That's dangerous.

00:03:30.502 --> 00:03:32.545
It's okay.

00:03:33.630 --> 00:03:34.631
Kotori-chan!

00:03:35.632 --> 00:03:36.841
Now what?

00:03:37.675 --> 00:03:39.052
I'll fetch my bow, and...!

00:03:39.052 --> 00:03:39.761
No way!

00:03:41.513 --> 00:03:43.723
See? It totally understood you!

00:03:44.933 --> 00:03:47.018
Now, now.

00:03:48.978 --> 00:03:51.022
Are you okay, Kotori-chan?

00:03:51.022 --> 00:03:53.733
Uh-huh. I hope they don't dislike me...

00:03:54.734 --> 00:03:58.822
They like you. I believe they
were having fun and playing.

00:03:59.322 --> 00:04:01.282
Oh, the water?

00:04:02.909 --> 00:04:04.911
You're the Alpaca Whisperer.

00:04:05.286 --> 00:04:08.748
W-Well...it's my job to look after them.

00:04:13.169 --> 00:04:15.547
Wait, you came to our concert!
Hanayo-chan, right!?

00:04:15.547 --> 00:04:17.215
What? Um, yes...

00:04:17.507 --> 00:04:19.759
Oh, the first year who ran into
the auditorium to see us!

00:04:19.759 --> 00:04:21.594
R-Right...

00:04:22.220 --> 00:04:23.513
So, buddy...

00:04:23.513 --> 00:04:24.430
Huh?

00:04:24.430 --> 00:04:26.182
How about becoming an idol with us?

00:04:26.182 --> 00:04:28.101
Honoka-chan, that's so aggressive.

00:04:28.101 --> 00:04:29.519
I can tell you'd shine.

00:04:29.519 --> 00:04:32.355
Don't worry. It won't hurt.

00:04:32.355 --> 00:04:34.899
She's certainly acting the villain today.

00:04:35.441 --> 00:04:38.570
But we gotta start being a
little forceful, y"know?

00:04:38.570 --> 00:04:40.655
U-Um...

00:04:40.655 --> 00:04:42.907
Ni-Nishikino-san...

00:04:43.533 --> 00:04:46.119
Oops. Sorry, could you repeat that?

00:04:47.620 --> 00:04:51.291
...l think Nishikino-san
would make a good idol.

00:04:51.291 --> 00:04:54.878
Sh-She's got a fantastic singing voice...

00:04:54.878 --> 00:04:59.257
I know, right? I've got a huge crush
on that voice of hers, too.

00:04:59.632 --> 00:05:02.010
Why don't we try and recruit her, then?

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:04.637
I already did, but she's really against it.

00:05:04.637 --> 00:05:05.513
What?

00:05:05.513 --> 00:05:09.267
I'm so sorry. I shouldn't have brought it up...

00:05:09.267 --> 00:05:10.143
It's okay.

00:05:10.518 --> 00:05:11.436
Thanks.

00:05:13.396 --> 00:05:15.189
Kayo-chin!

00:05:15.189 --> 00:05:18.651
If we don't hurry, we'll be late for gym!

00:05:19.777 --> 00:05:21.279
Excuse me.

00:05:23.406 --> 00:05:24.282
Let's go.

00:05:26.034 --> 00:05:27.994
We should be heading back, as well.

00:05:27.994 --> 00:05:29.162
Yep.

00:05:29.162 --> 00:05:30.038
Okay.

00:05:31.247 --> 00:05:32.999
That's it for today.

00:05:32.999 --> 00:05:34.375
Okay.

00:05:34.959 --> 00:05:38.212
Kayo-chin, have you decided
which club you'll join?

00:05:38.212 --> 00:05:40.798
Yesterday, you told me you'd
have an answer today.

00:05:41.049 --> 00:05:43.384
Oh? D-Did 1?

00:05:44.636 --> 00:05:46.554
Maybe I'll decide tomorrow, then.

00:05:46.554 --> 00:05:49.849
You need to figure it out soon.
They're about to start their activities.

00:05:49.849 --> 00:05:51.142
R-Right...

00:05:51.643 --> 00:05:55.396
U-Um, Rin-chan, which club are you joining?

00:05:55.396 --> 00:05:57.774
I'm thinking Track Club.

00:05:57.774 --> 00:05:59.817
Track Club, huh?

00:06:00.276 --> 00:06:02.862
Wait. Don't tell me.

00:06:02.862 --> 00:06:05.615
You're thinking about joining
the school idol group.

00:06:05.615 --> 00:06:09.327
What!? Th-That's...not true...

00:06:11.829 --> 00:06:13.915
I knew it.

00:06:13.915 --> 00:06:15.083
That's not—

00:06:15.083 --> 00:06:19.629
No use trying to lie to me, Kayo-chin.
You futz with your fingers when you lie.

00:06:19.629 --> 00:06:21.214
I know your "tell."

00:06:21.881 --> 00:06:25.843
Come on. I'll go with you to
see the upperclassmen.

00:06:25.843 --> 00:06:29.222
What!? B-But that's really not...!

00:06:29.222 --> 00:06:31.724
There's no way I can be an idol...

00:06:31.724 --> 00:06:35.436
You're a really cute girl, Kayo-chin.
You'd be a fan favorite.

00:06:35.436 --> 00:06:37.230
J-Just... Just wait.

00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:38.106
Wait!

00:06:39.440 --> 00:06:44.112
Um, if I can...may I ask you...
something really selfish?

00:06:44.112 --> 00:06:46.739
Yeah, sure. What is it?

00:06:46.739 --> 00:06:53.579
If I say I'm going to become an idol...
W-Will you become one with me?

00:06:53.579 --> 00:06:55.707
Me?

00:06:55.707 --> 00:06:56.582
Yes.

00:06:58.292 --> 00:07:02.213
No way, no how! An idol's life just isn't for me.

00:07:02.213 --> 00:07:04.674
I'm not all that girly, y"know?

00:07:04.674 --> 00:07:06.759
I got this short boyish hair, too.

00:07:07.051 --> 00:07:08.261
That's not...

00:07:08.261 --> 00:07:09.554
You remember way back when?

00:07:11.431 --> 00:07:12.140
Cute!

00:07:12.598 --> 00:07:14.934
Rin-chan, you look really nice in that skirt!

00:07:14.934 --> 00:07:16.394
You think?

00:07:18.730 --> 00:07:19.731
You're wearing a skirt!

00:07:19.731 --> 00:07:21.774
Weird, you always wear pants.

00:07:21.774 --> 00:07:23.568
I didn't know you even own a skirt!

00:07:23.568 --> 00:07:25.194
C'mon, race ya to school!

00:07:25.194 --> 00:07:26.320
Yeah, let's go!

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:29.407
Maybe...I'll run home and change real quick.

00:07:30.825 --> 00:07:34.412
Someone like me can't be an idol.

00:07:35.538 --> 00:07:36.914
Rin-chan...

00:07:46.507 --> 00:07:48.009
Nishikino-san?

00:07:57.310 --> 00:07:58.394
Did she just...?

00:08:06.986 --> 00:08:07.612
This is...

00:08:11.991 --> 00:08:14.660
Hardly any students attended their concert.

00:08:14.660 --> 00:08:19.582
I believe school idol activities are nothing
but a detriment to Otonokizaka High.

00:08:19.582 --> 00:08:23.169
However, moving to restrict student activities
because of the school's situation is...

00:08:23.169 --> 00:08:28.674
In that case, let the student council work
independently to keep the school open!

00:08:28.674 --> 00:08:30.051
That, I cannot do.

00:08:30.051 --> 00:08:31.094
Why not?

00:08:31.094 --> 00:08:34.680
Despite what you say, they aren't
entirely without their fans.

00:08:35.515 --> 00:08:36.974
That's from the concert...

00:08:38.184 --> 00:08:39.977
Someone must've been recording them.

00:08:43.564 --> 00:08:45.775
Wh-What?

00:08:46.734 --> 00:08:49.278
S-So amazing...

00:08:52.782 --> 00:08:53.366
Yes?

00:08:53.366 --> 00:09:00.581
U-Um, I'm in Maki-san's class.
My name is Koizumi...

00:09:03.709 --> 00:09:05.795
You'll have to wait a little bit.

00:09:05.795 --> 00:09:08.548
She had to stop by the hospital first.

00:09:09.340 --> 00:09:10.133
The hospital?

00:09:10.133 --> 00:09:15.096
Correct. Our family runs a hospital, and we
plan to pass it on to her someday.

00:09:15.346 --> 00:09:17.682
I see.

00:09:17.682 --> 00:09:19.225
This is such a pleasant surprise.

00:09:19.225 --> 00:09:22.770
She's never had a single friend over
since starting high school.

00:09:22.770 --> 00:09:24.438
It was becoming rather worrisome.

00:09:26.774 --> 00:09:29.277
I'm home. Do we have a guest?

00:09:32.780 --> 00:09:34.699
H-Hello.

00:09:35.741 --> 00:09:37.577
I'll prepare you both some tea.

00:09:37.577 --> 00:09:39.996
I'm sorry for stopping by uninvited.

00:09:39.996 --> 00:09:41.330
Do you need something?

00:09:43.749 --> 00:09:45.626
Actually...you dropped this.

00:09:45.626 --> 00:09:48.254
It's yours, right?

00:09:48.254 --> 00:09:50.715
Wh-Where did you get it?

00:09:50.715 --> 00:09:52.216
I'm sorry.

00:09:52.216 --> 00:09:53.551
Why're you apologizing?

00:09:54.427 --> 00:09:56.387
<i>Well.. thanks.</i>

00:09:57.138 --> 00:10:01.017
You were checking out the p's poster
at school today, weren't you?

00:10:01.017 --> 00:10:04.520
Who, me? You're mistaken.
That doesn't sound like me at all.

00:10:04.812 --> 00:10:08.107
But that's where I found
your student notebook...

00:10:08.107 --> 00:10:10.735
I...I already said you're...you're mista—!

00:10:11.527 --> 00:10:13.154
O-Ow...!

00:10:15.364 --> 00:10:16.532
Are you okay?

00:10:16.991 --> 00:10:18.784
P-Perfectly all right.

00:10:18.784 --> 00:10:21.787
No thanks to you for suggesting
such a strange thing.

00:10:22.788 --> 00:10:24.624
Don't laugh!

00:10:28.669 --> 00:10:31.088
You think I should become a school idol?

00:10:31.088 --> 00:10:36.677
Yes. I would always walk by the
music room after classes...

00:10:37.386 --> 00:10:39.972
Just because I hoped
I'd get to hear you sing.

00:10:40.765 --> 00:10:41.807
Me?

00:10:41.807 --> 00:10:47.104
Yes. I love your voice so much,
I wish I could hear it forever.

00:10:47.104 --> 00:10:48.022
That's why...

00:10:48.022 --> 00:10:48.981
Even so...

00:10:50.399 --> 00:10:53.110
It's been decided that I'll study
medicine in college.

00:10:53.110 --> 00:10:54.362
I see.

00:10:55.905 --> 00:11:00.034
My song's come to an end, as it were.

00:11:03.287 --> 00:11:07.083
Anyway, don't you want to be an idol?

00:11:07.083 --> 00:11:08.084
What?

00:11:08.084 --> 00:11:11.796
You were watching the concert with
such intensity the other day.

00:11:11.796 --> 00:11:14.465
You mean, you were there, too?

00:11:14.465 --> 00:11:17.593
No! I just happened to be passing by...

00:11:18.678 --> 00:11:21.055
If you want to do it, then you should.

00:11:21.055 --> 00:11:24.934
If you do...I'll support you, somewhat.

00:11:27.478 --> 00:11:29.063
Thank you.

00:11:33.359 --> 00:11:36.779
Everyone has their own issues to deal with...

00:11:36.779 --> 00:11:39.573
Japanese Sweets
Homura

00:11:39.573 --> 00:11:42.368
Maybe I'll buy my mom a little something.

00:11:43.744 --> 00:11:45.288
Oh, welcome!

00:11:47.707 --> 00:11:49.041
Senpai!

00:11:51.419 --> 00:11:53.045
Love Live!

00:11:53.629 --> 00:11:54.630
Welcome!

00:11:54.630 --> 00:11:56.215
P-Pardon the intrusion.

00:11:56.757 --> 00:12:00.011
I gotta watch the store for a bit,
so do you mind waiting upstairs?

00:12:00.011 --> 00:12:01.721
S-Sure.

00:12:07.601 --> 00:12:08.811
Let's see...

00:12:12.106 --> 00:12:14.942
I-If only they were at least this big...

00:12:23.367 --> 00:12:25.036
Ta-da!

00:12:25.036 --> 00:12:26.495
Thanks a bunch!

00:12:28.331 --> 00:12:29.915
Wh-What should I do?

00:12:34.628 --> 00:12:35.921
Did you just see that!?

00:12:39.633 --> 00:12:41.469
I-I'm so sorry.

00:12:41.469 --> 00:12:44.347
Don't worry. I should be
apologizing to you, really.

00:12:44.347 --> 00:12:47.558
I seriously can't believe Umi-chan
was practicing idol poses.

00:12:47.558 --> 00:12:50.478
I-It's because you left me alone to go work!

00:12:50.478 --> 00:12:51.604
Uh, um...

00:12:51.604 --> 00:12:53.689
I'm here, you two!

00:12:54.648 --> 00:12:55.941
Sorry for intruding...

00:12:55.941 --> 00:12:58.444
Wait, are you gonna be an idol with us!?

00:12:58.611 --> 00:13:02.156
She just happened to stop by the store,
so I thought I'd treat her to some food.

00:13:02.156 --> 00:13:05.451
The Homura family specialty:
Homura manju, AKA Homuman!

00:13:05.451 --> 00:13:06.786
They're yummy!

00:13:07.244 --> 00:13:09.789
Honoka-chan, I brought my laptop today.

00:13:09.789 --> 00:13:10.998
Cool, thanks.

00:13:10.998 --> 00:13:13.834
Mine broke right when I needed it most!

00:13:14.293 --> 00:13:16.170
- Oh, thanks.
- No problem.

00:13:16.462 --> 00:13:19.507
Were you able to find that video?

00:13:19.507 --> 00:13:23.302
I didn't look yet, but it's probably there.

00:13:23.302 --> 00:13:24.637
Yeah, that's it!

00:13:24.637 --> 00:13:25.638
Really?

00:13:29.225 --> 00:13:31.727
Who do you think recorded us...?

00:13:31.727 --> 00:13:34.021
Truly an impressive view count.

00:13:34.021 --> 00:13:36.190
That many people have watched us?

00:13:36.190 --> 00:13:38.692
Look, we nailed this part.

00:13:38.692 --> 00:13:44.281
We practiced that bit a bunch, so I nearly
stopped to celebrate when we did it right.

00:13:45.491 --> 00:13:48.661
Oops. Sorry, Hanayo-chan.
Can you see it over there?

00:13:53.499 --> 00:13:54.417
Koizumi-san?

00:13:54.417 --> 00:13:55.668
Y-Yes!

00:13:56.419 --> 00:13:59.213
Why not give being a school
idol an honest shot?

00:14:00.756 --> 00:14:03.717
I'm really not the right type for it...

00:14:04.093 --> 00:14:06.637
I have awful stage fright.

00:14:07.138 --> 00:14:09.181
I don't feel I'm suited to this, either.

00:14:09.181 --> 00:14:13.269
I tend to mess up the lyrics,
and I'm not super athletic.

00:14:13.269 --> 00:14:15.438
I forget stuff, and I'm careless!

00:14:17.440 --> 00:14:18.190
But...

00:14:18.774 --> 00:14:22.236
If we were professional idols,
we would fail overnight.

00:14:22.236 --> 00:14:29.243
But as school idols, we can try and
motivate ourselves to achieve our goals.

00:14:30.911 --> 00:14:33.289
It's what makes a school idol, a school idol.

00:14:33.289 --> 00:14:36.417
If you wanna do it, just go for it.

00:14:36.417 --> 00:14:38.752
Naturally, our training regimen is quite strict.

00:14:38.752 --> 00:14:40.129
Umi-chan.

00:14:40.129 --> 00:14:40.796
Excuse me.

00:14:45.050 --> 00:14:48.012
Think it over and let us know
when you find your answer.

00:14:48.387 --> 00:14:50.806
Our door's always open!

00:15:10.951 --> 00:15:13.245
"Amazingly, the haze blurring..."

00:15:13.245 --> 00:15:15.581
- "The outline had disappeared.”
- If you wanna do it, just go for it.

00:15:15.998 --> 00:15:17.041
- That will do.
- They're right.

00:15:17.041 --> 00:15:18.834
Next, Koizumi-san.

00:15:18.834 --> 00:15:20.044
Oh! Y-Yes?

00:15:20.461 --> 00:15:21.337
The next section.

00:15:21.337 --> 00:15:22.671
Okay...

00:15:23.214 --> 00:15:26.217
"What was the emotion that
Yashiro displayed in the..."

00:15:26.217 --> 00:15:29.512
"Sentence that began
'Fr-From a distant mou—'?"

00:15:32.681 --> 00:15:34.225
All right, enough.

00:15:34.725 --> 00:15:35.643
Okay.

00:15:36.352 --> 00:15:39.021
Next up, Sato-san.

00:15:39.021 --> 00:15:39.522
Sure.

00:15:39.897 --> 00:15:44.527
"What was the emotion that Yashiro
displayed in this sentence?"

00:15:45.861 --> 00:15:47.947
- Really?
- Really, really!

00:15:50.699 --> 00:15:52.159
What're you doing here?

00:15:52.952 --> 00:15:54.286
Nishikino-san...

00:15:54.828 --> 00:16:01.460
You have a beautiful voice. You just
need to work on vocal projection.

00:16:01.460 --> 00:16:02.169
But...

00:16:09.426 --> 00:16:10.135
Okay.

00:16:11.387 --> 00:16:12.429
Let's start.

00:16:18.185 --> 00:16:20.354
Louder. Stand up.

00:16:20.646 --> 00:16:21.647
O-Okay.

00:16:31.198 --> 00:16:31.991
And together...

00:16:38.539 --> 00:16:40.583
See? Doesn't that feel good?

00:16:42.334 --> 00:16:44.295
Yes. It's really fun.

00:16:47.965 --> 00:16:49.592
Okay, then once more.

00:16:49.592 --> 00:16:51.719
Kayo-chin!

00:16:53.137 --> 00:16:55.764
And Nishikino-san...?
What are you doing here?

00:16:55.764 --> 00:16:57.725
She was cheering me up.

00:16:57.725 --> 00:16:59.602
N-Not really...

00:16:59.602 --> 00:17:02.563
More importantly, you gotta go
see the upperclassmen today...

00:17:02.563 --> 00:17:04.690
and tell them you've decided
to become an idol.

00:17:04.690 --> 00:17:06.066
O-Okay...

00:17:06.066 --> 00:17:10.112
Don't rush her. I think she needs to
build up more confidence first.

00:17:10.112 --> 00:17:13.449
And who're you to butt in
on our conversation?

00:17:14.783 --> 00:17:15.951
I'm not butting in.

00:17:15.951 --> 00:17:18.495
If she wants to sing, that would
be the better plan for her.

00:17:18.495 --> 00:17:22.708
Kayo-chin sucks at making up her mind,
SO you gotta force her to decide!

00:17:22.708 --> 00:17:26.962
Is that so? She didn't seem that way
when she and I talked yesterday.

00:17:27.504 --> 00:17:29.298
Um, please don't fight.

00:17:34.219 --> 00:17:37.139
Kayo-chin, let's go before the
upperclassmen head home.

00:17:37.139 --> 00:17:38.098
What? But...

00:17:38.098 --> 00:17:38.932
Wait!

00:17:38.932 --> 00:17:39.850
Huh?

00:17:39.850 --> 00:17:42.519
If you insist on going now, I'll take you.

00:17:42.519 --> 00:17:45.564
I can advise you better
when it comes to music.

00:17:45.564 --> 00:17:47.775
After all, I wrote that song for J's!

00:17:47.775 --> 00:17:49.109
What? Really?

00:17:49.902 --> 00:17:52.196
Well, um...

00:17:53.030 --> 00:17:54.406
Never mind that. Let's go.

00:17:55.616 --> 00:17:57.868
Stop! If anyone's gonna
take her, it should be me.

00:17:57.868 --> 00:17:58.535
No, me!

00:17:58.535 --> 00:18:00.037
Me!

00:18:00.037 --> 00:18:01.622
I'm taking her!

00:18:01.622 --> 00:18:02.998
- What's your problem!?
- Someone...

00:18:02.998 --> 00:18:06.335
- I won't allow it!
- Someone, please rescue me!

00:18:08.796 --> 00:18:11.465
So...does this mean you want her to join?

00:18:11.465 --> 00:18:15.886
Yeah. Kayo-chin has always
wanted to be an idol.

00:18:15.886 --> 00:18:17.388
That's not relevant.

00:18:17.805 --> 00:18:19.973
This girl has a pretty good singing voice.

00:18:19.973 --> 00:18:21.809
What do you mean "it's not relevant"?

00:18:21.809 --> 00:18:23.560
I meant exactly what I said.

00:18:23.560 --> 00:18:26.814
But I still haven't, um...

00:18:26.814 --> 00:18:29.149
How long are you gonna
put off making this choice!?

00:18:29.149 --> 00:18:30.901
You should totally go for it!

00:18:30.901 --> 00:18:32.736
Agreed.

00:18:33.362 --> 00:18:36.240
If you want to do something, you should do it.

00:18:36.573 --> 00:18:37.783
B-But...

00:18:37.783 --> 00:18:40.994
Projecting your voice is easy,
like we practiced earlier.

00:18:40.994 --> 00:18:42.871
Even you can do it.

00:18:42.871 --> 00:18:47.584
I know you've always
dreamed of being an idol.

00:18:50.045 --> 00:18:51.213
Rin-chan.

00:18:53.132 --> 00:18:54.299
Nishikino-san.

00:18:56.385 --> 00:18:59.471
You can do this. And I'll always stick by you.

00:18:59.471 --> 00:19:02.266
Don't forget, I said I'd support
you as well, somewhat.

00:19:03.475 --> 00:19:07.479
Um, I'm.. . K-Koizumi...

00:19:22.244 --> 00:19:25.372
My name is Koizumi Hanayo.

00:19:25.372 --> 00:19:29.418
I'm a first year. I'm short. I'm quiet.

00:19:29.418 --> 00:19:33.088
I'm shy, and I'm not particularly
good at any one thing.

00:19:33.881 --> 00:19:39.845
But I truly believe that I want to be
an idol more than anyone else!

00:19:39.845 --> 00:19:43.140
Please accept me as a member of J's!

00:19:46.310 --> 00:19:47.770
It'll be our pleasure.

00:19:53.692 --> 00:19:54.860
Can't wait to sing with you.

00:20:11.919 --> 00:20:14.296
Kayo-chin, well done.

00:20:14.296 --> 00:20:15.881
Why are you crying?

00:20:15.881 --> 00:20:17.174
Because...

00:20:17.925 --> 00:20:19.301
Nishikino-san, aren't you crying, too?

00:20:19.843 --> 00:20:22.846
Who, me? I would never.

00:20:22.846 --> 00:20:24.640
And? How about you two?

00:20:25.140 --> 00:20:26.850
What'll you do?

00:20:26.850 --> 00:20:30.103
Huh? What about us?

00:20:30.103 --> 00:20:30.896
Huh?

00:20:31.230 --> 00:20:34.107
We're still looking to recruit more members.

00:20:34.107 --> 00:20:35.108
Yep.

00:20:44.618 --> 00:20:49.456
Do we have to wake up this early for
morning practice every single day?

00:20:49.456 --> 00:20:51.124
That much should be obvious.

00:20:51.124 --> 00:20:52.793
Really?

00:20:52.793 --> 00:20:54.461
Yes, really.

00:20:56.255 --> 00:20:57.548
Kayo-chin!

00:21:00.175 --> 00:21:01.844
Good morning!

00:21:01.844 --> 00:21:04.471
Huh? Where'd your glasses go?

00:21:04.930 --> 00:21:06.974
I decided that I'd like to try contacts.

00:21:07.474 --> 00:21:09.351
Do I look strange now?

00:21:09.351 --> 00:21:12.521
No, this is a cute look. Like, really cute.

00:21:12.688 --> 00:21:14.857
You look nice.

00:21:14.857 --> 00:21:16.191
Nishikino-san...

00:21:17.693 --> 00:21:18.443
So...

00:21:19.194 --> 00:21:23.282
Since you decided to change yourself,
why not change how you refer to me?

00:21:23.282 --> 00:21:24.199
Huh?

00:21:26.159 --> 00:21:29.121
To be fair, I'll call you both by
your first names, as well.

00:21:29.121 --> 00:21:30.497
Hanayo. Rin.

00:21:33.250 --> 00:21:34.376
Maki-chan.

00:21:35.043 --> 00:21:36.837
Maki-chan!

00:21:36.837 --> 00:21:39.006
Maki-chan, Maki-chan, Maki-chan!

00:21:39.006 --> 00:21:40.132
What's your deal?

00:21:40.132 --> 00:21:42.342
Maki-chan, Maki-chan!

00:21:42.342 --> 00:21:43.552
Enough already.

00:21:43.552 --> 00:21:45.304
You're embarrassed!

00:21:45.304 --> 00:21:46.972
No, I'm not.

00:21:46.972 --> 00:21:48.599
Maki-chan, you're so cute!

00:21:48.599 --> 00:21:49.683
Stop it.

00:22:00.068 --> 00:22:01.361
Idol Club, huh...?

00:22:06.950 --> 00:22:09.870
You're nowhere near good enough
to call yourselves idols!

00:22:15.083 --> 00:22:20.714
Sunao ni oikakete yuukide oikakete Chase after
it with honesty, chase after it with courage.

00:22:21.006 --> 00:22:26.261
Chiisana negai ga ashita wo tsukuru That one
small wish is what will help to create tomorrow.

00:22:26.595 --> 00:22:32.684
Dekirukamo minna ga nozomunara It might
be possible if we all want it to come true.

00:22:32.684 --> 00:22:39.650
Dare yori ganbacchae tonikaku Jjounetsu no mama ni Give it
more effort than anyone else and stay as passionate as ever.

00:22:39.650 --> 00:22:44.696
Mezasu no wa kireina kaze fuku michi Let's aim to
find our path while riding on a beautiful wind.

00:22:45.614 --> 00:22:51.161
Hane no youni ude agete Spread your
arms out wide like they're your own wings.

00:22:51.161 --> 00:22:56.416
Mabushii mirai e to tobuyo We'll use
them to take off into our bright future.

00:22:57.626 --> 00:23:03.924
Kitto seishun ga kikoeru sono shunkan ni kikoeru You can hear the
songs filled with our youth, you can hear it in this one moment.

00:23:04.383 --> 00:23:09.596
Egao nara itsu no hi mo daijoubu As long as
we see you smiling, every day is worth it!

00:23:09.596 --> 00:23:15.978
Kitto seishun ga kikoeru sono shunkan ga mitaine You can hear the
songs filled with our youth, we want to see you at that moment.

00:23:15.978 --> 00:23:21.858
Tonari ni kimi ga ite (ureshii keshiki) I want you
to be right beside me. (It's such happy scenery.)

00:23:21.858 --> 00:23:27.239
Tonari wa kimi nanda
Only when the one right there is you.

00:23:35.914 --> 00:23:39.334
Next time on Love Live!
"Nico Attacks"
